// ===================================================================
// SMSOne Enterprise Modulith — full database schema (dbdiagram.io / DBML)
// Generated from the 47 applied Flyway migrations (V1–V47). 52 tables.
// Import: dbdiagram.io → New → Import → paste this file (or Import DBML).
// ===================================================================

Project smsone {
  database_type: 'PostgreSQL'
  Note: '''
  Enterprise Spring Modulith template. Postgres is the system of record.
  RELATIONSHIPS: only 10 real foreign keys exist — all INTRA-module (a parent and its
  child rows in the same module). CROSS-module links are SOFT references, never FKs:
  `org_id` (uuid) → organization.kc_org_id (the tenant/Keycloak org), and
  `user_subject`/`subject` (varchar) → app_user.subject. Those are drawn here as
  coloured refs so the tenant hub is visible, but the database enforces no FK on them.
  '''
}

